<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr-CA"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Page introuvable | Lave-Auto du Parc</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png">
<style>
:root{--nuit:#0b0b0c;--charbon:#141518;--ligne:rgba(255,255,255,.09);--ligne-f:rgba(255,255,255,.18);--txt:#f5f4f2;--gris:#a6a29c;--acc:#f4761b;--acc-clair:#ff954a;--acc-voile:rgba(244,118,27,.13);--ok:#4cc38a;--r:14px}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--nuit);color:var(--txt);font-family:"Inter","Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.66;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
a{color:var(--acc-clair)}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
.wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
.topbar{background:var(--acc);color:#160b02;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;padding:9px 0}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(11,11,12,.94);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ligne)}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;height:68px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--txt)}
.logo img{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%}
.logo b{display:block;font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.1}
.logo i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--acc);font-weight:700}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-left:auto;align-items:center}
.nav-links a:not(.btn){color:var(--gris);text-decoration:none;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:600}
.nav-links a:not(.btn):hover{color:var(--acc-clair)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid transparent;font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;text-decoration:none;font-family:inherit}
.btn-p{background:var(--acc);color:#160b02}
.btn-p:hover{background:var(--acc-clair)}
.btn-g{background:transparent;color:var(--txt);border-color:var(--ligne-f)}
.btn-g:hover{border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--acc-clair)}
.btn-sm{padding:9px 16px;font-size:.84rem}
.crumbs{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--gris);padding-top:18px}
.crumbs a{color:var(--gris)}
.hero{padding:6px 0 50px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ligne);background:radial-gradient(900px 340px at 85% -10%,var(--acc-voile),transparent 70%)}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:var(--acc);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:18px 0 14px}
.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--acc)}
h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.15;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em}
h1{font-size:clamp(1.85rem,5vw,2.9rem);margin-bottom:16px}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3.2vw,1.9rem);margin-bottom:12px}
h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:6px}
.lead{color:var(--gris);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:64ch}
.cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:24px}
section{padding:44px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ligne)}
section p{color:#d8d5d0;max-width:70ch}
section p+p{margin-top:12px}
.grid{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:22px}
.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr))}
.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(290px,1fr))}
.card{background:var(--charbon);border:1px solid var(--ligne);border-radius:var(--r);padding:22px}
.card.pop{border-color:var(--acc)}
.card .sous{color:var(--acc-clair);font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem;margin-bottom:8px}
.prix{margin:14px 0 4px;border-top:1px solid var(--ligne)}
.prix div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ligne);font-size:.92rem;color:#d8d5d0}
.prix b{color:var(--acc-clair);font-size:1.1rem;white-space:nowrap}
.hint{color:var(--gris)!important;font-size:.84rem}
ul.check{list-style:none;margin:12px 0 4px}
ul.check li{position:relative;padding:4px 0 4px 24px;font-size:.93rem;color:#d8d5d0}
ul.check li:before{content:"\2713";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--ok);font-weight:800}
ol.steps{list-style:none;counter-reset:s;display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:20px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr))}
ol.steps li{counter-increment:s;background:var(--charbon);border:1px solid var(--ligne);border-radius:var(--r);padding:18px}
ol.steps li:before{content:"0" counter(s);color:var(--acc);font-weight:800;font-size:.9rem;letter-spacing:.1em;display:block;margin-bottom:6px}
ol.steps li p{font-size:.93rem}
.tablewrap{overflow-x:auto;margin-top:18px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.92rem}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:11px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ligne);vertical-align:top}
th{color:var(--acc-clair);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
td{color:#d8d5d0}
td.c,th.c{text-align:center}
details{background:var(--charbon);border:1px solid var(--ligne);border-radius:10px;margin-top:10px;padding:0 18px}
summary{cursor:pointer;padding:15px 0;font-weight:700;list-style:none}
summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
summary:after{content:"+";float:right;color:var(--acc);font-weight:800}
details[open] summary:after{content:"\2013"}
details p{padding:0 0 16px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
.chips span{border:1px solid var(--ligne-f);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-size:.84rem;color:var(--txt)}
.links a.card{display:block;text-decoration:none;color:var(--txt)}
.links a.card:hover{border-color:var(--acc)}
.links a.card b{display:block;color:var(--acc-clair);margin-bottom:4px}
.links a.card span{color:var(--gris);font-size:.9rem}
.note{border-left:3px solid var(--acc);background:var(--acc-voile);padding:14px 18px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin-top:18px}
dl.trajet{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:6px 18px;max-width:340px;margin-top:14px;font-size:.93rem}
dl.trajet dd{color:var(--acc-clair);font-weight:700;text-align:right}
footer{padding:40px 0 34px;color:var(--gris);font-size:.9rem}
footer address{font-style:normal;line-height:1.9}
footer a{color:var(--acc-clair);text-decoration:none}
.barre-bas{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;display:none;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;background:rgba(11,11,12,.96);border-top:1px solid var(--ligne);z-index:60}
.barre-bas a{flex:1}
@media(max-width:760px){table{font-size:.8rem}th,td{padding:8px 6px!important}.nav-links a.hide-m{display:none}.barre-bas{display:flex}body{padding-bottom:70px}.topbar{font-size:.78rem}}
</style></head><body>
<header><div class="wrap"><nav class="nav"><a class="logo" href="/"><img src="/apple-touch-icon.png" alt="" width="40" height="40"><span><b>Lave-Auto</b><i>du Parc</i></span></a></nav></div></header>
<main><div class="hero"><div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Erreur 404 · Page not found</span>
<h1>Cette page n'existe pas</h1>
<p class="lead">Le lien est peut-être incorrect ou la page a été déplacée. / This page doesn't exist.</p>
<div class="cta"><a class="btn btn-p" href="/">Retour à l'accueil</a><a class="btn btn-g" href="/lave-auto-montreal">Lavage à la main</a><a class="btn btn-g" href="/hand-car-wash-montreal">Hand car wash</a></div>
</div></div></main></body></html>
